ription":"","creator":{"login":"wesm","id":329591,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTU5MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/329591?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesm","html_url":"https://github.com/wesm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":50,"state":"closed","created_at":"2011-10-10T01:38:02Z","updated_at":"2012-02-11T22:38:46Z","due_on":"2011-10-31T07:00:00Z","closed_at":"2011-11-10T04:10:30Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2011-10-14T21:01:49Z","updated_at":"2011-10-14T21:15:38Z","closed_at":"2011-10-14T21:15:38Z","author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"the following groupby transform results in things getting casted to object...\n\n``` python\ndf = DataFrame({'d' : [1.,1.,1.,2.,2.,2.],\n                'c' : np.tile(['a','b','c'], 2),\n                'v' : np.arange(1., 7.)})\n# in IPython\nIn [34]: df\nOut[34]: \n   c  d  v\n0  a  1  1\n1  b  1  2\n2  c  1  3\n3  a  2  4\n4  b  2  5\n5  c  2  6\n```\n\nNow write a small transform function:\n\n``` python\ndef f(group):\n    v = group['v']\n    group['v2'] = (v - v.min()) / (v.max() - v.min())\n    return group\n```\n\nNote that this also handles NAs since the v variable is a pandas Series object.\n\nNow group by the d column and apply f:\n\n``` python\nIn [36]: df.groupby('d').apply(f)\nOut[36]: \n   c  d  v  v2 \n0  a  1  1  0  \n1  b  1  2  0.5\n2  c  1  3  1  \n3  a  2  4  0  \n4  b  2  5  0.5\n5  c  2  6  1  \n```\n","closed_by":{"login":"wesm","id":329591,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTU5MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/329591?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesm","html_url":"https://github.com/wesm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pandas-dev/pandas/issues/237/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pandas-dev/pandas/issues/237/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}